  lex_splices_err_space_comment.pcpp - Lexical: a blank after a splice in a comment

  Break step of lex_splices: the same in a // comment, LX0201 at the
  backslash, a warning: the comment still goes on to the next line.
  Its bytes are part of the test (see above): edit it with an editor
  that keeps them as they are.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe lex_splices_err_space_comment;

/*
  @@test
    kind build
  @@end
*/

begin
  // a comment // WARN LX0201@37 // \ 
  that goes on
end.
